WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.890
Valentine's Day?

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:05.230
Yes.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.790
Is it already that time of year?

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.400
I wonder if they're made to not think
of things we don't want to remember...

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.410
These brains of ours...

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:20.880
What do you mean?

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.920
You're not going to give Rei-sama chocolates?

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.940
I do give her chocolates.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.440
Every year.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.960
But in exchange for the chocolates
that grow larger every year,

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.190
what am I supposed to give her in return?

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:32.850
What?

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.660
You receive a gift from
Rei-sama every year, too?

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:40.620
Contrary to the way she looks,
Rei-sama is very much a girl inside,

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.200
and her skill at making sweets
would put a professional to shame.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.410
Now that I have my health,

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:50.210
I don't suppose she'll let me get
away with store-bought chocolates.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.610
Why does it have to be chocolates anyway?

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.650
I'm sure it could be something else.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.340
If it's hand-made...

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:57.550
Oh...

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.660
Everything keeping Yoshino-san warm right now...

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:06.630
...was all hand-made by Rei-sama...

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.290
I'm sorry I couldn't be of any help.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.230
What?

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.890
With what chocolates to give Sachiko-sama.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.370
My first Valentine's Day with Sachiko-sama...

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:24.580
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:29.310
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:34.150
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.150
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.490
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:43.830
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:49.370
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:03.140
Maria Watches Over Us

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:25.900
Surprising Chocolate - Part I

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.900
Valentine's Day?

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.170
You know what it is, don't you, Shimako-san?

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.210
Oh please, Yumi-san.

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.280
Even I know what Valentine's Day is.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.610
February 14th. Valentinus.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:46.750
A holiday named after the
martyred Italian saint, right?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.950
It should be unrelated to chocolates, though...

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:52.860
Then, you're not going to give
Rosa Gigantea any chocolates?

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:56.360
This is your first Valentine's
Day with her too, right?

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.260
I hadn't even given it any thought.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.030
I-I see.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.070
I'm sorry I couldn't be of any help.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:06.230
But it's no use asking me.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:10.070
Since, unfortunately, I have
neither a big nor a little sister.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:14.480
Maybe Valentine's Day is a more
complicated event than I'd thought.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.890
Both Yoshino-san and
Shimako-san were unhelpful.

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.180
Who else could I ask?

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.610
Why does it have to be a first-year student?

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:23.380
What?

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.660
Both second and third-year students...

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.290
...have experienced being
first-year students, you know.

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:31.130
Oh!

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.530
Third-year students are busy
with college entrance exams,

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:34.500
so if I were to ask anyone...

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:37.630
Chocolates to my big sister?

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.730
Yes, I gave her some last year, but why?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.970
Oh, no, I was hoping you might
tell me just as a reference.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.710
They were nothing fancy.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.210
Bitter chocolate truffles.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:50.980
I could write down the recipe for you.

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.880
T-Truffles?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:55.220
I don't think I can use this as reference.

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:57.590
It's nothing to brag about,

00:04:57.590 --> 00:05:01.690
but about the only sweet-making
I've done is cut out donuts.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.430
I sense many difficulties lying ahead of me.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.490
Treasure Hunt
Where Are the Boutons' Chocolates?!

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:11.440
"Treasure Hunt. Where Are
the Boutons' Chocolates"?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:12.900
What is this?

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.840
The school paper's Valentine's Day event.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.280
The three boutons will hide
hand-made chocolates on campus.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.510
Wow, that sounds like fun!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:25.180
P-Pardon me!

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:30.950
Yumi, it confuses the issue,
so please remain quiet for a while.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:32.820
Right.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:40.060
I appreciate the idea,
but we cannot offer our cooperation.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.200
Don't say that! Please!

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:44.870
I'm striving to improve the school paper's image!

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.310
You know, it's the sort of event...

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.470
...that will really appeal to
the general student population.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:49.940
We cannot comply.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:50.850
Firstly,

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:54.080
there is a problem with leaving food
unattended for a long period of time...

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.070
...and I find it questionable to openly
bring chocolates to school.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:01.550
But the teachers are tolerant of
such matters for Valentine's Day.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.020
Valentine's Day, is it?

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:08.050
Gifts unilaterally forced upon a
recipient are nothing but annoyances.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.030
Could it be that Sachiko-sama...

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:14.060
...does not view Valentine's Day
in a favorable light?

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:18.060
When I think of the school being
filled with the scent of chocolate...

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.170
Could it be that she hates chocolates, too?!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:25.510
Then, if we change the treasure,
you would agree to this plan?

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:28.280
We'll hide hand-written Valentine's Day cards.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.070
Red, yellow, and white ones.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:35.320
It seems people originally sent cards
instead of giving chocolates.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:39.480
And how about we have them trade
in those cards for additional prizes?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:40.590
Additional prizes?

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.330
A ticket for a date with a bouton for half a day.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.590
Hold on!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.970
If this is sponsored by the Yamayuri Council,

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.160
that means we won't be able
to participate, correct?!

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.370
In which case,

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:53.170
someone other than myself will go
on a date with my Onee-sama?!

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:58.080
I am against this!
I am absolutely against this!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.020
I think it is wrong to turn an
individual's personal time...

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.380
...into a commodity!

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:10.690
Then, with unanimous agreement
of the Yamayuri Council,

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:12.390
we decline to participate in this event.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:21.270
The plan was rejected, in part due to
Yoshino-san's vehement opposition,

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.400
but the next day...

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.140
Did you decide on your
answer to the school paper?

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:33.870
Rosa Chinensis...

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:36.870
And Rosa Gigantea...

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.340
And even Rosa Foetida...

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:44.220
Dear sisters, if all three of you
are directing us to do so,

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:48.430
you leave us no choice but to agree
to it, though we are unwilling.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.920
Obstinate as ever, aren't you?

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:56.560
And who was it that chose this
mule to be your little sister?

00:07:57.070 --> 00:08:00.560
It was I. So, I would like
you to become more flexible.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.270
Mingling with the general student population...

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.570
...is a good thing.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:09.610
Since making Yumi-chan your soeur,
your countenance has improved.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:10.450
Right?

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.720
Round One, Sachiko-sama suffers a K.O. defeat.

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:19.490
Rei.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:20.720
Yes?

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.690
You know what I wish to say, don't you?

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:31.130
I'll cooperate with the school paper.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:32.330
I'm against it!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:33.340
Rosa Foetida,

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.470
don't you think you are going too far,
pressuring her like that?!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:37.980
And Rei-chan, you're just as bad!

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.010
I am speaking with Rei.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:43.640
I would ask that anyone unrelated
to this matter stay out of it.

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:49.460
The more upset you become,
the more it will egg her on.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.420
Don't you see that?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.130
You still have a lot to learn, Yoshino-chan.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:58.430
Round Two, Rei-sama and Yoshino-san forfeit.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.400
Round Three.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.300
So there you have it. Good luck.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.300
I understand.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.100
Sei-sama wins by default.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:08.960
What's this?

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.100
You seem unhappy about this, Yumi-chan.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.640
Not exactly...

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:16.480
Lucky her...

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:24.030
If only Sachiko-sama would show
me the smallest of smiles,

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.720
I would feel at ease.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.660
Thank you for giving your willing consent.

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:30.800
The hiding places for the cards...

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.790
...will be limited to areas that
students normally have access to.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.840
And I would like to exclude
classrooms and club rooms...

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.500
...that would give an advantage
to certain groups of students.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.470
Aw, this is going to be the
worst Valentine's Day ever.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.850
If only I weren't a bouton's petite soeur,

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.110
I could participate, too.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.720
For this event,

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:54.520
could we make it so it's only the
bouton's who are participating?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:55.210
What?

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.520
That way,

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.490
everyone except the boutons could
take part in the treasure hunt.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.900
I was thinking it wouldn't
be a bad deal for you two.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.170
Wouldn't you want that one in
a few hundred chance...

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.070
...to try to get a date with your big sister?

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:11.570
Well, of course!

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:13.570
I would!

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.510
We do not mind.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.150
If the boutons' petite soeurs also participate,

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.580
it will be newsworthy as well.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:23.950
It is precisely for such miscellaneous tasks...

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.580
...that I could use my little sister's help.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:30.620
I guess the idea of a date with me has
not even entered Sachiko-sama's mind.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.790
Finally, I have just one request.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.060
I want you to include the Rose Mansion...

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:37.620
...among the places where
the cards can be hidden.

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.120
Onee-sama... Why is that?

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.370
This is primarily the student council's office,

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.940
but somewhere along the way,
the Roses have become consecrated...

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:47.840
...and everyone gives this
place a wide berth now.

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:49.780
So, before I graduate,

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:53.340
I want to see the Rose Mansion
bustling with ordinary students.

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:55.380
That is my dream.

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:58.680
I understand, Onee-sama.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.060
On your final Valentine's Day,

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:03.320
I shall gift you with the best day ever.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:09.200
Unlike the way I'm always fretting
about my relationship,

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:12.690
I guess Yoko-sama and Sachiko-sama
have a strong bond between then.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.640
Just watch, I'm going to find
Rei-chan's card, no matter what.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.470
I don't have such confidence.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:24.840
Why not?

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.980
The soeurs have an advantage just
by being the soeurs, you know.

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:28.610
What?

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:31.920
We have a good understanding of
their interests and the way they think,

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.980
so those will be clues for us to find the cards.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:38.450
Also, if we stick close, they might
accidentally blurt out a hint.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:42.220
Besides, based on their attitude,
you'll know when they hid it.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:45.230
It might just be Yoshino-san
who has an advantage,

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:47.170
having nothing to do with being a soeur.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:53.170
This is going to happen a lot
until Valentine's Day comes.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:56.380
I have a feeling we won't feel
welcome at the Rose Mansion, either.

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:59.650
When Sachiko-sama becomes Rosa Chinensis,

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.240
she will become even busier.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:07.450
Once that happens, Sachiko-sama
and I might grow apart even more.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.260
Yoshino, thanks for waiting.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.120
Let's go home.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.220
See you later, Yumi-chan.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:13.450
Good night.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:14.850
Good night.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:18.900
What's wrong?

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:22.130
Nothing...

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.500
I have to make sure I'm not
a burden to my Onee-sama.

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.640
I have to make sure I do
not worry my Onee-sama.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.280
We boutons had a matter to
discuss amongst ourselves,

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:32.640
so perhaps I've made you feel lonely.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.880
It's become so dark already. Shall we go home?

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:37.840
Yes.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:40.820
I wasn't able to tell her.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.960
My feelings of loneliness have
nothing to do with the darkness.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:46.320
Onee-sama...

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:56.890
Maria Watches Over Us

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.230
Yumi-san, you really don't know anything?

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:05.470
About where the boutons
intend to hide their cards?

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:06.370
No...

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.540
But...

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.110
Some sort of hint, at least?

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.790
We'll be participating in the game too,

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.620
so we really haven't been told anything.

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:14.880
I see.
I see.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:18.150
Well, we're going to the library then.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:22.430
My, my.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:25.830
The Yumi-san, known for her
cheerfulness, letting loose a sigh?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:29.660
Does that mean this is an unpleasant
situation for the little sisters?

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:30.670
You could say that.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:33.270
Aren't you going to the library?

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:37.170
It seems everyone goes there at lunch
to look at books on chocolate.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.170
It appears Sachiko-sama dislikes chocolate.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:41.610
Surely, you jest.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.110
Sachiko-sama was eating
Yule log cake at Christmas.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.050
The one baked by Rosa
Foetida en bouton herself.

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:51.960
Then, I wonder if she's just against the custom...

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:54.220
...of giving out chocolates on Valentine's Day.

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:58.130
Though, either way,
the end result is the same for me.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:02.440
Deprived of the joy of giving
chocolate on Valentine's Day...

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:04.100
...plus, the object of your affections...

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:06.730
...may end up going on
a date with someone else...

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.840
I can see how that could get to you.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.110
There's no place for you at the Rose Mansion...

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:14.050
...and talk in the classroom has
turned to nothing but Valentine's Day.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.810
If you'd like, you can use this.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:20.720
Some of my own recipes are pasted in there too.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.690
Thank you very much.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:26.950
How about something like this?

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.800
Rei-sama is so animated.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.370
Her "pretty boy" looks get in the way...

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.130
...and she doesn't seem to
fit that sort of image at all,

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:37.500
but I guess she's actually
a really caring person.

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:41.740
Well, she has gotten along with
Yoshino-san all this time, after all.

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:47.450
S-Sachiko-sama!

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:48.980
Why are you so surprised?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.480
N-No reason. Well, please excuse me.

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:56.450
I'm sure they have another
Valentine's Day meeting anyway.

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:58.690
Do you have some business to attend to?

00:14:58.830 --> 00:14:59.920
Yes, sort of.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:03.390
And Sachiko-sama seems to be out of sorts, too.

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:06.460
Then, quit wasting your time and hurry along.

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:08.160
I-I will.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.800
Sachiko, don't talk to her like that.

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.970
I was the one who dragged Yumi-chan over here.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.070
I see.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.050
Sorry, but could you drop by
the Chrysanthemum Class...

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.710
...and give this to Yoshino for me?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.220
Considering how disagreeable
Sachiko-sama seems to be,

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:30.750
will it really be impossible for
me to give her chocolates?

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.860
Still unsure, it's now the
day before Valentine's Day...

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:40.860
Please let Valentine's Day be
the best day ever for me as well.

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:50.770
Music Room

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.210
Shizuka-sama.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.820
Pardon me. Choir practice is soon, isn't it?

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.980
It's fine. No one is here yet anyway.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.020
Valentine's Day looks to be
a trying day in many ways.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:10.390
Particularly for the
bouton petite soeurs this year.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:11.700
Well...

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.270
Let me see.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:17.960
I intend to give Rosa Gigantea chocolates too.

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.040
What?

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:21.970
It's the perfect day to let
someone know how you feel, right?

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:25.200
But Rosa Gigantea didn't return her feelings...

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.510
What a resilient person...

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.640
Rosa Gigantea is kind,

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.280
so she seems like the sort who will
accept any gift of chocolate.

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:36.710
But Rosa Chinensis en bouton will be difficult.

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:37.550
What?

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.360
Last year, on Valentine's Day,

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:42.630
Sachiko-san was pressed to accept
a veritable mountain of chocolate,

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:46.260
which she rejected, one and all,
looking plainly disgusted.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:47.400
What?!

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.270
Though, I do think that is one form of kindness.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.970
Rejecting them... is?

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:58.950
I might not be able to give
Sachiko-sama any chocolate, after all...

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.940
Why don't you have as much
fun with it as you can, too?

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:01.640
What?

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:04.120
I'm sure even the agonizing and uncertainly...

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.920
...will make for great memories.

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:09.360
Last year, I was just an idle spectator,

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:12.480
so this year, I'm going to make
memories to take with me to Italy.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.760
So, you should too.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:16.890
Shizuka-sama...

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:19.500
Good luck with the treasure hunt, too.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:20.760
If it were me,

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:25.770
I would want the person who
understands me best to find my card.

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:26.640
Thank you.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:30.810
That's right...

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:33.280
I may not be able to give her any chocolates,

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.580
but I'll do my best in the game.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.810
I want to be the first to get to the red card.

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:41.450
As her little sister, I want to be the
one who understands her best.

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.360
Then,

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:46.220
maybe I can win some small amount
of approval from Sachiko-sama.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:08.970
What are you, Gon the Little Fox?

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.620
Rosa Gigantea...

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:16.350
What is this? Your philosophy of what's proper?

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.590
Lately, you've been sneaking around,
doing chores here,

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.930
and then going home before
anyone sees you, haven't you?

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:24.830
I-I feel like I shouldn't stay too long, so...

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.430
Well, that's fine.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:29.370
It's not my place to say
anything about it anyway.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:32.630
And it would be ungracious of me
to spoil your self-satisfaction.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.130
H-Have I done something wrong?

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:40.050
I feel like right now, you're letting
your emotions carry you away.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:41.510
I can't explain it really well.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.870
Self-satisfaction?

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:48.120
Oh, Onee-sama.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:49.980
I got in!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:50.580
What?

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:53.420
Congratulations!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:57.760
Oh! Rosa Gigantea's been accepted
by the school of her choice.

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:01.690
And she wanted to let Shimako-san
know before anyone else.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.000
They have no need for chocolates.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.910
With the White Rose sisters,

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:08.700
their bond is so strong,
even without any tangible trappings.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.440
Come on, now.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.610
Isn't Gon the Little Fox going to congratulate me?

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:15.450
Congratulations!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:17.780
Thank you.

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:20.690
Man, it was tough.

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:23.160
For the longest time,
I hadn't planned on going to college,

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.990
so I only started studying for
the entrance exams this year.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:27.020
What?

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:30.230
You got in after only studying for one month?

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:33.860
I feel bad for Eriko and Yoko,
who still don't know their results,

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:36.360
but it looks like I'll get
to really enjoy tomorrow.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:41.000
You are participating in
the treasure hunt as well?

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:44.600
I can hardly just stand by and
watch something this fun.

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:48.950
I've been telling you for a while now...

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.920
...to keep it to a little shriek, haven't I?

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.140
Yumi-chan!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.620
Rosa Gigantea, please stop!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:54.710
Hold it right there!
Rosa Gigantea, please stop!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:55.950
Please!

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.190
I said, hold it!

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:58.880
No, I will not!

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:03.220
Onee-sama! Good day!

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.090
What could it be about?

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.830
Her gaze seems even more
critical than usual today.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.340
You seem to be having a great deal of fun.

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:17.510
Rosa Gigantea came in and told us she got...

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:21.470
So you enjoy yourself when
Rosa Gigantea is present.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.410
Huh?

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:23.810
So?

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:25.720
When did you grow to hate me so,

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:27.880
that you do not even want to see me?

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.390
What? Me? Hate you, Onee-sama?

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.020
Are you saying you don't?

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.400
Then why have you been avoiding me?

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:38.160
Avoiding you? But I haven't...

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.170
You have been avoiding me.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:44.440
At first, I thought it was
because I am a bouton...

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:45.610
...and you were avoiding me to...

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:48.400
...be on a fair footing for
the Valentine's Day event.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.950
But you have been behaving normally
towards both Rei and Shimako.

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:54.450
Onee-sama...

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:58.550
Even when you come to the Rose Mansion,
you leave before I arrive...

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:01.450
...and you disappear from my presence
as if you are fleeing from me.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:02.890
Like this morning.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.090
This morning?

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:08.230
In front of Maria-sama,
you left as if to avoid me.

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:11.430
What? Did I see Sachiko-sama this morning?

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.060
And it's not like I've actually been avoiding her...

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:15.430
What is the matter?

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.570
If there is something you want to say,
say it clearly!

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:22.040
I was trying not to get in her way.

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:25.570
That's why I would just
clean the place and go home.

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:29.380
But as Rosa Gigantea said,

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:31.540
that was nothing more than self-satisfaction.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.420
Why have you grown silent?

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:37.820
Why won't you confront me
with the words in your heart?

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:40.190
I can't know anything if you're like this!

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:46.700
I'm sorry, Onee-sama...

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:49.000
Um, Sachiko-sama...

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:50.970
Shimako, come along.

00:21:57.410 --> 00:21:58.910
No matter what should happen,

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:01.750
I could never grow to hate Sachiko-sama.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:04.420
But I was unable to say anything.

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:06.850
Instead, only the tears came pouring out.

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:12.730
And the outline of the person I
care so much about grew blurry...

